summary:
  A reading in flight runs on after Stop.

history:
  Stop means off. A helper that goes on holding a connection to the station
  for up to twenty seconds after it is a connection the listener was told
  had ended.

target:
  package/contents/ui/Loudness.qml

find:
          function on_WantsPlayingChanged() { if (loud.app._wantsPlaying !== true) loud._end(); }

replace:
          function on_WantsPlayingChanged() { if (loud.app._wantsPlaying !== true) settle.stop(); }

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_a_stop_ends_the_reading_and_removes_its_file.
  Line-neutral.
